          {
            "title": "Gear",
            "content": "Before the game, choose one gear of each type and put both copies of the chosen cards in your deck (24 + 6 = 30). Return the other gear cards to the box.\nSWORD: Gear: Sword of Steel / Gear: Sword of Silver.\nARMOR: Gear: Wolf Medallion / Gear: Armor of the Forgotten Wolf.\nPOTION: Gear: Tawny Owl / Gear: Blizzard.\nThis deck carries ALL 12 gear cards (36 cards): remove the 6 you did not choose."
          },
          {
            "title": "Ongoing schemes",
            "content": "After resolving an ONGOING scheme, leave it face up instead of discarding it. Check its discard condition only at the end of your turn. You can have only one ongoing scheme at a time: playing another discards the current one."
          }
        ]
